WEBVTT

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.910
What class is she in?

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.740
She looks intimidating.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.740
What's the big idea?!

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:19.950
Sorry, my bad.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.490
Watch where you're going! What if you hurt somebody?!

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:11.230
Are you trying to make me lower my guard? If you are, then...

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.590
Hold on! Are you okay?!

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.930
Let's go.

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:27.710
Ryner! Wake up, we're moving!

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.370
Ryner again?

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.040
Just leave him alone, Kiefer.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:35.510
Doesn't it bother you, having that said about you?

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:40.010
What bothers me is that I couldn't skip today's training because of you.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.010
Geez...

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.280
<i>"What am I doing?"</i>

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:01.350
No wasting money!

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:02.580
Okay!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.200
Is there anything you want, Kiefer?

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:11.390
You're a fourteen-year-old girl. You don't have to be so hard on yourself.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:14.580
I don't really...

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:17.380
Okay, sister Naia, sister Kiefer!

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.880
Here.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:23.070
Aren't they pretty?

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.310
Thanks.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.600
What's a group of Estabul spies laughing about in a place like this?

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.650
Kiefer! Take Lemile and get out of here!

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:36.610
R-Right!

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:40.350
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.150
Kiefer, hurry and run!

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:58.750
I offer up this contract, to bear the wicked spirit beast which sleeps in the earth.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.230
Is sister Naia okay?

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:23.950
She's fine. We'll meet her at the border.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.690
Your older sister's already caught up with you.

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:31.500
See?

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:38.270
She said she'd protect her little sisters, even if it meant her life!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.120
Are you kidding? It's way too little, way too late!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:53.240
I... I'll kill you!

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:54.960
I like it!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.690
Kiefer!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:04.780
Stop it! You're killing her!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:05.030
Be silent!
Stop it! You're killing her!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:05.720
Be silent!

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:09.530
Sis... I can't breathe...

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:16.010
S-Stop...

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:17.940
Not my sister...

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:22.340
I'll do... anything you say...

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.210
Anything?

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:30.750
Accursed Estabul spy, you'll even betray your nation for your little sister.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.510
<i>I care for Ryner.</i>

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.260
<i>To me, Ryner is...</i>

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:49.630
<i>I have no right to say these things.</i>

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.290
<i>I'll betray Ryner after this, too.</i>

00:05:56.140 --> 00:06:00.270
<i>I hate it. I don't want to kill anyone else.</i>

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:04.000
<i>Please, Ryner... Help me.</i>

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.970
What a nice nap that was.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:19.050
Geez, Ryner, you sleep too much.

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.460
Sleep-driving is strictly forbidden.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:33.760
But I haven't slept at all.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:37.400
That one's gotten enough sleep for both of you, so it should be fine.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:46.630
Private Kiefer Knolles!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:51.420
You'd better run, too! This place won't hold out much longer!

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:54.720
But, Captain! There are still civilians here!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:58.880
Forget about that! The Gastark army will be here any minute now!

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:10.520
<i>This military nation of Stohl boasts the greatest strength in the Menoris continent.</i>

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:14.300
<i>I thought they would have researched a bit into Ryner's Alpha Stigma.</i>

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:36.210
A-Are you all right?

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:47.520
I can't afford to die in here!

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.720
I offer up this contract,

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:55.240
to unleash the magic beast of light which dances through the skies!

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:04.040
No way, my magic was deflected? Does it have a magic coating?

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.950
A Stohl soldier?

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:26.070
Are you a fool? Stohl has already abandoned this village.

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.640
What do you think you can do alone?

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:32.360
What do you know? This is why I hate war!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:36.690
What's with you? You're a soldier that hates war?

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:40.890
Of course I am! Where in this world would you find someone who likes war?!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.410
So you're going to keep up the angry conversation,

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:48.250
while waiting for me to show an opening.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:53.120
That magic you just used isn't native to Stohl.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.780
Going right between Gastark and Stohl,

00:08:55.780 --> 00:09:00.100
risking your life to try and save people that aren't even from your homeland.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:05.030
You're just a fool.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:08.940
But I love that sort of fool.

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:13.550
The preparations are in order, Your Majesty.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.210
And the securing of the civilians?

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:17.210
All complete.

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:20.210
A large-scale spell from the Stohl army is approaching.

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:21.770
Please get back, Your Majesty.

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:24.830
Your Majesty? It couldn't be...

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.670
Your Majesty!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.470
I, too, hate war.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.010
I hate blood, and tears, and every sad thing.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:51.640
I hate it when friends die. I hate it when children die.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:57.430
For a cutie like you to die would be such a waste, I won't hear of it.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:01.830
But as long as nations exist, wars will happen.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:05.690
I always consider ways to reduce the casualties, even by a little,

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:07.860
if it has to be that way.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:14.670
Not just Gastark, but Stohl as well... No, the entire Menoris continent.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.300
I'll save every person on it, and eliminate war. That's my dream.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.480
Waging war to eliminate war?

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.520
You're contradicting yourself!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:29.610
Yeah, I guess I am.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.690
That's why I'll...

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:35.440
I'll... use this!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:50.140
Contractor. I answer thy call.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:56.950
Come, offer thy compensation, and in doing so, unleash my power.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:59.430
Take my left eye.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.220
I need power!

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:05.840
The contract is completed.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.230
Now, give me power!

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:14.610
Glouvil! I release you!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:23.410
I will not let this sacrifice be in vain. I am a slaughterer. I...

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.660
I will advance forward!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.740
I will...

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.750
...mow everything down!

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.570
Your Majesty!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.990
I'm fine. Tell Stohl this.

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:13.000
If they don't want another attack like this...

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.480
...they'd better surrender!

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:16.720
Your eye...

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.000
It's compensation.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.300
For using the Sacred Sword Glouvil.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:27.030
His Majesty has already offered up his sense of smell and his right leg as sacrifices.

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.390
That's horrible...

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:34.570
I just took an unbelievable number of lives.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:37.540
To save even more future lives...

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:44.360
If those can be bought with but a single left eye, it's a small price to pay!

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:47.150
Do you regret it?

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:53.580
People who kill and don't have regret are scum.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:59.710
If you want to save many lives, come to my side.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:03.720
Join me, Riphal Edea, king of Gastark!

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:12.060
I won't, not yet.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.200
But someday, I shall come to your side, Your Majesty.

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:21.480
Someday, huh? Ah, well. See you then.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.690
Saving the world, hm?

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:28.110
Riphal Edea...

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:41.160
I hear Lieutenant General Froaude is behind it.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:44.960
Surely you jest! You mean to say he raised his hand against his own father?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.270
How long do you plan to keep me as a field marshal?

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:50.800
How long?

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.050
You go back to being field marshal!

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:56.070
That way I can quit being the one with a clear conscience.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:59.570
You are the most appropriate person for the position "Your Greatness", Field Marshal Klom.

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:01.730
Are you mocking me?

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:04.140
No, I mean it.

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:07.280
What's with that? That somehow pisses me off even more.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:11.280
That part of you is a talent that attracts those in military circles.

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:15.200
That unbelievable simplicity.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:18.790
It makes you appealing, and makes the soldiers want to follow you.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.780
Now you're making fun of me!

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:22.790
All right, that's enough.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.950
You two really don't get along do you?

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.720
I would like to have Field Marshal Claugh Klom pay a visit to Estabul.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.460
To Estabul?

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:36.180
In order to reform the Estabul army, and integrate it into the Roland army.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:42.360
Now, look! There are still tons of people in the Estabul army who resent Roland!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.360
If we tell them to merge their armies, we're bound to get insubordination!

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:51.920
No. Now that a new wind has begun to blow due to the purge,

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.370
it is an item which should be strongly prioritized.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:58.700
Given that Lady Noa Ehn enjoys great support from the people of Estabul,

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:02.440
and given how well you get along with her, it's a job you should be able to handle.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:05.530
Are you telling me to take advantage of Noa?

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:06.630
You don't like that?

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.030
Of course I don't!

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:09.760
It is necessary for this nation.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:14.530
The nation of which Your Majesty speaks.

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:18.350
Does it include the people of Estabul as well?

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:24.360
Of course. You are all my valuable citizens.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:27.670
There is no lie or deceit in my desire

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:30.690
to avoid ever fighting with them again.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:38.630
I once had a friend named Kiefer Knolles.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:44.750
But when Kiefer betrayed us as a spy from Estabul,

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:47.630
most of my friends died.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.920
Then, does Your Majesty resent Estabul?

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.210
Perish the thought.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:59.350
Even now, Kiefer is my dear friend.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:03.810
She was in a helpless situation.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:08.360
Her older sister was killed by Roland, and her younger sister was taken hostage.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.860
She was forced to become a double agent.

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:15.810
But there was no lie in her smiling face.

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:20.310
She undoubtedly cried out for help in her heart many times.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:26.840
But I never noticed it.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:31.430
As long as I am king, there will be no further war between Roland and Estabul.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.050
So...

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.930
...I want your aid.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:44.140
I understand. So long as it is within my power, I shall do anything.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:53.300
At the same time as you integrate the Estabul army and strengthen our forces,

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:57.880
you'll make selections from Estabul military personnel and let their faces be seen.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.180
It's brilliant.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:01.400
I can only hope it goes so well in practice.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:06.670
I shall be heading to the Runa Empire soon.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.370
To Runa?

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:11.970
It seems as though Duke Stearied, who hatched the plot to assassinate Your Majesty,

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:14.420
had some contact with Runa nobility.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:17.030
I am going to ascertain the facts.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:20.560
Watch yourself. I cannot have you die.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:24.680
I shall take those words to heart.

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:34.650
It's going to be a pain to rescue Kuku like this.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:37.110
What will become of our grand dream

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:41.480
of throwing a magnificent dumpling party with Kuku?

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:45.930
How does your dream become my dream by extension?

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:50.170
I shall do my best for our grand dream!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:55.700
What's wrong?

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:05.140
There doesn't seem to be anyone in the house.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.790
Yeah, I don't sense any presence.

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:14.710
D-Damn you both...

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.360
Well, shit.

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:34.300
My, if it isn't Ryner and Ferris.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.930
What a pleasant surprise to see you again here.

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:38.300
Were you waiting for us?

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:42.220
We were. We're quite interested in you, Ryner.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.880
As the owner of a unique Alpha Stigma.

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:49.330
An enormous power, one incomparable to that of other bearers.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:54.400
Even my Rule Fragment, the Elemio Comb, was virtually no match for it.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:58.500
And on top of that, even after awakening and going berserk,

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.280
you've returned to normal like this.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:02.780
Just who are you?

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:06.530
If I knew that, we wouldn't have nearly this much trouble.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:11.010
The child you two secured is also an Alpha Stigma bearer, is he not?

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:12.910
Where did you hide him?

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:14.940
You know about Arua?

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.500
Of course.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:21.010
We hold an interest in the Alpha Stigma, after all.

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:22.510
Kuu!

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:28.520
I offer up this contract, to bear the wicked spirit beast which sleeps in the earth!

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:35.770
There's no escaping, Kuu!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:57.040
Runa soldiers?

00:19:57.530 --> 00:20:01.230
Let's split up! Leave this to me and take care of Arua.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:08.410
Oh yes, Ryner. Before we part ways, allow me to tell you one thing.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:14.440
The girl you call Kuku is being confined in the manor of a noble of this territory.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.050
I'll be waiting for you there.

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:19.070
You scumbag.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.940
My father, or rather, the king, is currently ill,

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:32.700
and he has left the country for his convalescence.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.710
Is that right?

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:37.800
Pardon my intrusiveness, but where did he go?

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:41.950
Perhaps Cassla in the north? Or Imperial Nelpha?

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:45.470
I'm afraid the details are not...

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:49.530
Ah, I beg your pardon. Women are neutral in political affairs.

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:52.170
That is proper behavior for a lady of this country.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:57.460
It is an honor merely to set eyes upon such a lovely lady of your station on this occasion.

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.990
I see.

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:07.740
The king of Runa has betrayed his alliance with Roland,

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:11.860
and joined hands with Gastark. Is that it?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:15.630
Thus why he would be unable to meet with me.

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:20.750
Furthermore, the one in charge of the plot to assassinate the king of Roland

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.200
was the king of the Runa Empire himself.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:25.980
I've told you everything. Save me!

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:28.470
Please, get rid of these... these monsters!

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:43.780
The Gastark messengers slaughetered all of the Runa soldiers in an instant.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.610
I certainly can't let this go unchallenged.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:50.000
I suppose I'll have to dispose of them as well.

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:27.340
<i>Why is it always one pain-in-the-ass situation after another? Didn't I say it already?</i>

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:30.390
<i>All you northern people, please just stay north and keep out of here.</i>

00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:31.880
<i>This sucks and I don't want to deal with it.</i>

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:35.180
<i>Revenge and all that isn't my style.</i>
